1
00:00:00,031 --> 00:00:02,901
79 Lakhs per month with a single prompt?

2
00:00:03,422 --> 00:00:05,810
If you are also looking for a shortcut, then this video is not for you.

3
00:00:06,473 --> 00:00:10,165
Hi, my name is Sachin and welcome to 100 days of helping you build your own startup.

4
00:00:10,406 --> 00:00:12,252
And I will make you build this.

5
00:00:13,025 --> 00:00:19,393
As soon as you hear startup, you think of investment, inventory, VC funding, office space, and many more.

6
00:00:19,413 --> 00:00:22,077
I am not talking about that startup.

7
00:00:22,157 --> 00:00:24,099
We don't want to sell any oil or factory here.

8
00:00:24,119 --> 00:00:27,604
I am talking about a startup that can only be made with a laptop and wifi.

9
00:00:27,884 --> 00:00:32,350
A software product that you can make at home and sell on the internet.

10
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:37,582
But you think I am going to give you the same knowledge that AI will do everything for you and money will be money.

11
00:00:37,883 --> 00:00:38,745
So you are wrong my friend.

12
00:00:39,126 --> 00:00:42,354
AI will help you but it's not your replacement.

13
00:00:42,374 --> 00:00:45,281
So you have to get the product's idea, decisions, taste.

14
00:00:45,501 --> 00:00:50,473
So the main goal of this series is how to find the best idea.

15
00:00:50,453 --> 00:00:55,564
how to build it in minimum investment, and the most important part, how to find users.

16
00:00:55,724 --> 00:00:59,592
Because making a product is half the game and distributing it is half.

17
00:00:59,612 --> 00:01:02,598
But if you are looking for a shortcut, then this community is not for you.

18
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:12,900
But if you are consistent and ready for hard work, then after building 5 products in the last 2 years, whatever my learnings, whatever my success, failure, I am going to share everything here.

19
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:15,104
So that you don't have to repeat the mistakes I have made.

20
00:01:15,325 --> 00:01:18,070
So if you don't want to miss this opportunity, then follow it.

21
00:01:18,090 --> 00:01:19,313
Rest, see you tomorrow.

